  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Childhood Development Project in a Rural Remote Village in Blantyre, Malawi (&apos;23-&apos;25/1,546 million KRW)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the trust with the villagers formed through the Making a Better Village project and on the experiences and lessons learned from the ECD pilot program, BETTER WORLD improves the ECD education environment and operates a systematic ECD education program.  It helps the infants and children to grow holistically, the village to have an asset for self support and development, and the parents and villagers to improve the awareness and enhance self governing capacity through the ECD education program.  Finally, it contributes to achieve the SDGs 2 and 4 by improving the self reliance of the education and the quality of life of the local community.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to increase participation in ECD education and to expand the care function at home to help children development1.ECD &#xad50;&#xc721; &#xcc38;&#xc5ec; &#xc99d;&#xb300;
2. &#xc544;&#xb3d9;&#xc758; &#xc131;&#xc7a5;&#xbc1c;&#xb2ec;&#xc744; &#xb3d5;&#xb294; &#xac00;&#xc815;&#xacfc; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xc758; &#xb3cc;&#xbd04; &#xae30;&#xb2a5; &#xd655;&#xb300;</narrative>
